episode.description:
Louis is back on the road, this time to visit actor, footballer and professional hard man Vinnie Jones at his Sussex farm. The pair discuss Vinnie’s journey to sobriety, a bizarre standoff with Steven Seagal, and the real story behind those photos with Paul ‘Gazza’ Gascoigne. &nbsp;

&nbsp;

Warnings: Strong language and adult themes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

